   "seed": 375081143,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1763365941,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795277502750,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Postgres 18, as of migration 20261121180000. Everything up to 2026-11-21 is one migration (20261121120000); a database made before it is reset (docker compose down -v), not migrated. PK = primary key, FK = foreign key.\nSource of truth: db/migrations/*.sql (db/schema.sql is generated). All times are timestamptz (stored as instants); the database and every app session use TimeZone = UTC. Gold datasets are files in data/gold/, not tables.",
   "originalText": "Postgres 18, as of migration 20261121180000. Everything up to 2026-11-21 is one migration (20261121120000); a database made before it is reset (docker compose down -v), not migrated. PK = primary key, FK = foreign key.\nSource of truth: db/migrations/*.sql (db/schema.sql is generated). All times are timestamptz (stored as instants); the database and every app session use TimeZone = UTC. Gold datasets are files in data/gold/, not tables.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
