   "text": "PK id\nFK source_id \u2192 source, actor_id \u2192 actor\n   kind        list | transfer\n   args        jsonb: what it was asked, config\n   status      running | succeeded | failed\n   started_at, finished_at\n   counts, errors  jsonb\na run whose process died is closed as failed\nby the next run (advisory lock while alive)",
   "originalText": "PK id\nFK source_id \u2192 source, actor_id \u2192 actor\n   kind        list | transfer\n   args        jsonb: what it was asked, config\n   status      running | succeeded | failed\n   started_at, finished_at\n   counts, errors  jsonb\na run whose process died is closed as failed\nby the next run (advisory lock while alive)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
