   "text": "PK source_id, source_key\n                  e.g. ctis, EU CT number\nFK trial_id \u2192 trial\n   created_at, created_by\na new key never joins a trial that has another\nkey at the same source: it is its own trial\n(+ possible_duplicate); one writer decides\nidentities at a time (advisory lock)",
   "originalText": "PK source_id, source_key\n                  e.g. ctis, EU CT number\nFK trial_id \u2192 trial\n   created_at, created_by\na new key never joins a trial that has another\nkey at the same source: it is its own trial\n(+ possible_duplicate); one writer decides\nidentities at a time (advisory lock)",
